---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Fukuyama Castle Main Tower, Fukuyama, Hiroshima｜Nishikino｜WORKS"
  description=""
>


<section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">

  <!-- Background -->

  <picture>

    <!-- Smartphone -->
    <source
      media="(max-width: 768px)"
      srcset="/images/fukuyamacastle-mobile.jpg"
    />

    <!-- PC -->
    <img
      src="/images/fukuyama2.jpg"
      alt="Fukuyama Castle Main Tower"
      class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
      draggable="false"
    />

  </picture>


  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">

    <Container>

      <div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

        <!-- English -->
        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#f6e8c8]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          FUKUYAMA CASTLE MAIN TOWER
        </p>

        <!-- Title -->
        <h1
          class="mt-1 text-[48px] leading-[1.15] text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          福山城天守
        </h1>

        <!-- Subtitle -->
        <p
          class="mt-6 text-xl text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          The great castle that rose over Bingo, built in the final years of the Edo period.
        </p>

        <!-- Gold Divider -->
        <div class="mt-1">
          <img
            src="/images/gold-divider.png"
            alt=""
            class="w-[420px] h-auto select-none pointer-events-none"
            draggable="false"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Summary -->
        <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl">
        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </div>

  <!-- Scroll -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">

  <!-- Washi Background -->
  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
  />

  <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">


    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

        <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#9a8358]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          OVERVIEW
        </p>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        About the Work
      </h2>

      <p
        class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-base leading-10 text-[#55504a]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        Fukuyama Castle, built in what is now Fukuyama City, Hiroshima Prefecture, was a major early-modern castle in western Japan.<br>
        Constructed by the Tokugawa shogunate as an important stronghold for the administration and defense of western Japan, it flourished alongside the castle town throughout the Edo period.<br>
        Construction began in 1622 under Mizuno Katsunari, the first lord of Fukuyama Domain, and the castle was completed in the same year.<br>
        Its main tower was exceptionally distinctive, with its entire northern face clad in iron plates, a remarkably rare feature among Japanese castles.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-6xl"></div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">

      <!-- Left -->

      <div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            HISTORY
          </p>

        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          Fukuyama Castle and Its Main Tower
        </h2>

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

          Fukuyama Castle was built under Mizuno Katsunari, who entered Bingo Province with a domain valued at 100,000 koku in 1619. The castle was completed in 1622 and became the defining symbol of Fukuyama Castle and its domain.

          <br><br>

          The castle itself was developed as an important base for the Tokugawa shogunate's administration and defense of western Japan. It was one of the most sophisticated castle complexes constructed in the final years of the Edo period.

          <br><br>

          The main tower was a five-story, six-level structure with a basement, designed in the complex-style layered-tower form. Its most remarkable feature was the iron plating that covered the entire northern side of the tower, a remarkably rare structure in Japan.

          <br><br>

          Nearby stands the Fushimi Yagura, an extant structure said to have been relocated from the Matsunomaru East Turret of Fushimi Castle in Kyoto on the orders of Tokugawa Hidetada. Its elegant three-story white-plastered exterior preserves architectural characteristics of the Momoyama period.

          <br><br>

          The Fukuyama Domain passed from the Mizuno family, who ruled for five generations, to the Matsudaira family for one generation and then to the Abe family for ten generations. Until the Meiji Restoration, Fukuyama Castle served as the political center of the domain and its castle town.

          <br><br>

          However, following the Castle Abolition Ordinance of 1873, many of the castle's buildings, including its palaces and storehouses, were lost. During the Fukuyama air raid of 1945, the main tower and Oyuden bathing pavilion, both designated as National Treasures at the time, were also destroyed by fire.

          <br><br>

          In 1966, the main tower, Oyuden, and Tsukimiyagura were reconstructed as part of Fukuyama City's 50th anniversary celebrations. In 2022, a major renovation was carried out to commemorate the 400th anniversary of the castle's construction, restoring the distinctive iron-clad appearance of the northern side of the main tower.

          <br><br>

          For this work, I recreated the main tower as it appeared after the 2022 renovation, bringing its present-day form to life as a Japanese-style Minecraft build.

          <br><br>

          The interior was reconstructed based on models, plans, and historical research into the structure as it existed before the war. From the structural framework of the pillars to the spaces beneath the roof, I completed a detailed recreation and reconstruction of the castle's architecture.

        </p>

      </div>


      <!-- DATA -->

      <aside class="relative">

        <div
          class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]"
        >

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            DATA
          </p>

          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Work</p>
              <p class="text-base">Fukuyama Castle Main Tower</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Category</p>
              <p class="text-base">Japanese Castle・Main Tower</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Period</p>
              <p class="text-base">Early Edo period</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Location</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                1-8 Marunouchi, Fukuyama, Hiroshima 720-0061, Japan
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Construction</p>
              <p class="text-base">1622</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Builder</p>
              <p class="text-base">Mizuno Katsunari</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Structure</p>
              <p class="text-base">Complex-style layered-tower Main Tower</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Software</p>
              <p class="text-base">Minecraft Java Edition</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Work Type</p>
              <p class="text-base">Japanese Architecture・Reconstruction</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Status</p>
              <p class="text-base">Completed</p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>



    <div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          GALLERY
        </p>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-4xl"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        Gallery
      </h2>

      <div class="gallery mt-12">

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/fukuyama4.jpg"
            alt="Fukuyama Castle Main Tower"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/fukuyama1.jpg"
            alt="Fukuyama Castle Main Tower"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/fukuyama2.jpg"
            alt="Fukuyama Castle Main Tower"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/fukuyama3.jpg"
            alt="Fukuyama Castle Main Tower"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>


    <div class="mt-24 flex flex-wrap gap-4">

      <a
        href="/en/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← Back to Works
      </a>

      <a
        href="https://youtube.com/shorts/_70qfq3ZFxc"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        See More Works →
      </a>

    </div>


            <div class="mt-32 text-center">

      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          SHARE
        </p>

        <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        Share This Work
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">

        <!-- X -->
        <a
          id="x-share"
          href="#"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
        >
          X
        </a>

        <!-- Instagram -->
        <button
          type="button"
          id="instagram-share"
          class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
        >
          Instagram
        </button>

        <!-- Copy -->
        <button
          type="button"
          id="copy-url"
          class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
        >
          Copy URL
        </button>

      </div>

    </div>

  </Container>

</section>



<script>

  const sharePhrases = [
    "Found this.",
    "I kind of like this.",
    "Look at this.",
    "Found something interesting.",
    "Found something like this.",
    "Have you seen this?",
    "Found something.",
    "Came across this.",
    "Found something worth checking out."
  ];

  const randomSharePhrase =
    sharePhrases[
      Math.floor(Math.random() * sharePhrases.length)
    ];

  const pageUrl =
    "https://www.nishikinolab.net/en/fukuyamacastle/";

  const shareText =
    `${randomSharePhrase} Minecraft FUKUYAMA CASTLE MAIN TOWER | WORKS`;

  const xShareButton =
    document.getElementById("x-share");

  const copyButton =
    document.getElementById("copy-url");

  const instagramButton =
    document.getElementById("instagram-share");


  if (xShareButton) {

    xShareButton.setAttribute(
      "href",
      `https://x.com/intent/post?text=${encodeURIComponent(shareText)}&url=${encodeURIComponent(pageUrl)}`
    );

  }


  copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

    try {

      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

      if (copyButton) {

        copyButton.textContent = "Copied";

        setTimeout(() => {

          copyButton.textContent = "Copy URL";

        }, 2000);

      }

    } catch (error) {

      console.error(error);

    }

  });


  instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

    const dialog =
      document.createElement("div");


    dialog.innerHTML = `

      <div
        id="instagram-share-overlay"
        style="
          position:fixed;
          inset:0;
          z-index:9999;
          display:flex;
          align-items:center;
          justify-content:center;
          padding:24px;
          background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
          backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
        "
      >

        <div
          style="
            width:100%;
            max-width:420px;
            padding:36px;
            border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
            border-radius:28px;
            background:#fffdfa;
            box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
            text-align:center;
          "
        >

          <p
            style="
              margin:0;
              font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              letter-spacing:.35em;
              color:#a58c65;
            "
          >
            SHARE
          </p>


          <h3
            style="
              margin:14px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:24px;
              color:#2b2724;
              font-weight:400;
            "
          >
            Share on Instagram
          </h3>


          <p
            style="
              margin:20px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              line-height:2;
              color:#625a52;
            "
          >
            Copy the URL of this work page<br>
            and open Instagram.
          </p>


          <button
            id="instagram-open"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:28px;
              padding:14px 20px;
              border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
              border-radius:999px;
              background:#2b2724;
              color:#fff;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:15px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            Copy URL and Open Instagram
          </button>


          <button
            id="instagram-cancel"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:10px;
              padding:12px 20px;
              border:0;
              background:transparent;
              color:#8c8378;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            Cancel
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    `;


    document.body.appendChild(dialog);


    const overlay =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-share-overlay"
      );

    const openButton =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-open"
      );

    const cancelButton =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-cancel"
      );


    openButton?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      async () => {

        try {

          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(
            pageUrl
          );

        } catch (error) {

          console.error(error);

        }


        window.open(
          "https://www.instagram.com/",
          "_blank",
          "noopener,noreferrer"
        );


        overlay?.remove();

      }
    );


    cancelButton?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      () => {

        overlay?.remove();

      }
    );


    overlay?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      (event) => {

        if (event.target === overlay) {

          overlay.remove();

        }

      }
    );

  });

</script>

<style>

.work-hero {

  animation:
  heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;

  transform-origin:
  center;

}


@keyframes heroFloat {

  0% {

    transform:
    scale(1.03)
    translateY(0);

  }

  50% {

    transform:
    scale(1.06)
    translateY(-18px);

  }

  100% {

    transform:
    scale(1.03)
    translateY(0);

  }

}


section {

  position:
  relative;

}


section::before {

  content:
  "";

  position:
  absolute;

  left:
  0;

  top:
  0;

  width:
  100%;

  height:
  100%;

  pointer-events:
  none;

  background-image:

  radial-gradient(
    circle at 8% 10%,
    rgba(205,175,98,.08),
    transparent 18%
  ),

  radial-gradient(
    circle at 92% 82%,
    rgba(205,175,98,.06),
    transparent 22%
  );

}


aside {

  position:
  sticky;

  top:
  120px;

  height:
  max-content;

}


a {

  transition:
  .35s;

}



.gallery-frame {

  position:
  relative;

  padding:
  2px;

  border-radius:
  1.25rem;

  background:

  linear-gradient(
    to right,
    transparent 0%,
    rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
    rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
    rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
    transparent 100%
  );

  overflow:
  hidden;

}


.gallery-frame img {

  display:
  block;

  width:
  100%;

  height:
  auto;

  border-radius:
  calc(1.25rem - 2px);

  background:
  #f8f6f2;

}


.gallery-frame:hover {

  background:

  linear-gradient(
    to right,
    transparent 0%,
    rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
    rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
    rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
    transparent 100%
  );

}


@media (max-width:1100px) {

  section {

    overflow:
    hidden;

  }

}



@media (max-width:768px) {

  section:first-child {

    height:
    760px;

  }

  .gallery-frame {

    border-radius:
    1rem;

  }

  .gallery-frame img {

    border-radius:
    calc(1rem - 2px);

  }

}


</style>

</Layout>